sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant AdminAPI as Admin Offers API
    participant CustomerAPI as Customer Offers API
    participant PDF as OfferPdfService
    participant Email as BillingEmailPublisher
    participant Customer
    participant Fulfillment as OfferFulfillmentService
    participant Jobs as BullMQ Jobs
    participant Search as OpenSearch

    Admin->>AdminAPI: POST draft (standard + plan + project lines)
    AdminAPI-->>Admin: draft offer

    Admin->>AdminAPI: POST :id/archive
    AdminAPI->>PDF: generate eInvoice 330 PDF
    AdminAPI->>Email: publishOfferArchived
    AdminAPI->>Search: upsert offer document
    AdminAPI-->>Admin: archived offer

    Customer->>CustomerAPI: GET /pending
    CustomerAPI-->>Customer: pending offers

    Customer->>CustomerAPI: GET /:id + GET /:id/pdf
    CustomerAPI-->>Customer: detail + PDF

    alt Accept
        Customer->>CustomerAPI: POST /:id/accept
        CustomerAPI->>Fulfillment: fulfill immediate lines
        Fulfillment->>Jobs: schedule deferred lines (scheduledAt)
        CustomerAPI->>Email: publishOfferAcceptedConfirmation
        CustomerAPI->>Search: upsert accepted offer
        CustomerAPI-->>Customer: accepted offer
    else Decline
        Customer->>CustomerAPI: POST /:id/decline
        CustomerAPI->>Search: upsert declined offer
        CustomerAPI-->>Customer: declined offer
    end

    Note over Jobs: offer-expiration marks archived offers past expiresAt
    Note over Admin,AdminAPI: revoke allowed only in draft or archived
